See ../../ASSETS-LICENCE. A fork must replace every file in this directory
with its own; the app is built to ship without any of them.

⚠ WHAT IS HERE NOW IS A STAND-IN, not her work.

  ic_foreground.svg   a crescent and an eight-pointed star, built from
  ic_background.svg   geometry in the cloak's navy and the trim's gilt
  icon-1024.png       the two flattened, for a store listing

The artwork spec (design/astrolabe/guidelines/artwork-spec.md in the site
repository, item 1) reserves the launcher icon for her: the crescent-and-star
clasp at the throat of the cloak, drawn. When that arrives it replaces these
three files and the mipmaps generated from them, and nothing else changes —
the adaptive-icon XML already points at the right names.

⚠ The safe zone is the centre 264 x 264 of a 432 x 432 canvas. Android crops
the outer 168 to a circle, a squircle, a rounded square or a teardrop
depending on the launcher, and you cannot know which.
